[[Arper]], Italy, 2024. A remake of their Catifa 53 from 2001.

The seat shell is [[PaperShell]]. The frame is metal, and the two come apart.

So the shell goes one way and the frame goes another. No [[Monstrous Hybrid]].

The shell is matte black because that is how it comes out of the press. Nobody chose the color.

At the end the shell is meant to become [[BioChar]]. That needs a plant nearby that can do it.
